 981:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_rcc.c **** *\*\fun     Configures the PLL2 clock source and multiplication factor.
 982:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_rcc.c **** *\*\param   PLL_source(PLL2 entry clock source):
 983:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_rcc.c **** *\*\             - RCC_PLL_SRC_HSI         HSI oscillator clock selected as PLL2 clock entry
 984:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_rcc.c **** *\*\             - RCC_PLL_SRC_MSI         MSI oscillator clock selected as PLL2 clock entry
